The "statics" lists in wormholes.json come from the statics table of WormholeSystems
(https://github.com/WormholeSystems/WormholeSystems, database/seeders/data/wormhole_systems.csv at
commit 48c89bf0d11260567146e5b334ba2c27f4205754), distributed under the licence below. Everything
else in wormholes.json (wormhole types, hull classes, ship masses, system effects) is built from
CCP Games' Static Data Export. EVE Online and all related game data are the property of CCP hf.

